# Choice maps and navigation
@scenario tutorial_lesson_38
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties]
[set tutorial_excerpt sample_card]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: The topic map links branches to choices. Open config/ui/tutorial-topics.properties and find this lesson, then change its title.
# region link
# open_topic_map.title=Choice maps and navigation
# endregion
ginger: Restart the tutorial, advance past my introduction and select the renamed card on the tree. It still opens this script. Compare the card ID with open_topic_map in tutorial_hub.vns.
ginger: Drag empty space, scroll to zoom, or choose Fit map. Search by title or category with Ctrl+F or Command+F. Select a match to focus its card, then press Enter to open it. Full screen expands the game window. Press F11 again to return to its previous size.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_38]
[flag tutorial_done_38]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_8]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: You renamed the lesson in the map config. What should the next playthrough do?
> Open a new script with the same name as the new title. -> practice_hint
> Display the new title and open the same route. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: Title and destination are independent fields. Reopen the map and test the renamed card.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: Title and destination are independent fields. Reopen the map and test the renamed card.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the interactive lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: What must a lesson card's target match?
> A VNS choice target. -> correct
> The image file name. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: The map displays the title and icon, and navigates by the choice target.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: The map displays the title and icon, and navigates by the choice target.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
